        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wu'kenagu'zi wa v'antu'",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yav'aga v'antu' aho v'alamulaga kwingi'ha na ku'sambala mu welelo, na v'ana v'a ki'ki'ma v'av'yalagwa ku' wav'o. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'atundwa v'a ki'loho v'a Mulungu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6:2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "“V'atundwa v'a ki'loho v'a Mulungu,” Ku' Ki'ebulania v'ali' “V'ana v'a Mulungu v'a ki'gosya.” V'ingi v'ali'wiganika ku'v'a v'ali' v'atundwa v'a ku' ilunde ninga v'ali' v'amalaika v'a wu'gwe.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " v'av'awonaga v'enav'o v'aniki' v'a v'antu' ku'v'a v'ali' v'asoga, na v'isogolelaga v'aki'ma ki'ti' i'vi v'atogilwe na ku'v'atoola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wayombaga, “Myu'ye yanne ya wu'panga yi'kakowola kwikala mu muntu' nhananhana ku'nguno mweni'ki'li' ali' wa ku'fwa, na wikalo wakwe mu welelo wu'ku'v'a myaka igana li'mo na maku'mi av'i'li' du'.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu nsiku' zyeni'zyo na zya ha mbele, gav'age gali'ho mantu' mu welelo ago gav'age mav'yalwa ga v'atundwa v'a ki'loho ago ndi' galala na v'aniki' v'a v'antu'. Genago hu' gav'age mantu' makowozi ago gitanagwe Manefili, mantu' genago gav'age makumalu'ku mu itungo lya nsiku' zyeni'zyo zya kale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gu'ku' Mulungu wawonaga ku'v'a wu'kenagu'zi wa v'antu' wu'li' wu'hanya mu welelo, na ki'la ndaka ya miganiko ga v'antu' nsiku' zyose gav'aga ga wu'kenagu'zi du'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gu'ku' Mulungu wasayaga ku'v'atunda v'antu' mu welelo, na moyo gwakwe gwav'aga na wu'satu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wayombaga, “Nku'v'azimangu'zya v'antu' v'ose mu welelo av'o nav'atundile, haki'mo na ndimu zyose na vitundwa vingi' vya ku'yu'mba ha igu'lya na nsi', na nnoni zyose. Ku'nguno nu'saya ku'vitunda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sumbwa Nowa wapandi'kaga wu'soga ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mulungu ali'mupi'zya Nowa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I'yi' hu' mmola yamwa Nowa na wu'v'yalwa wakwe. Mwenu'yu' wav'age muntu' mugololoku ku' Mulungu na wa lole mugati' na v'antu' v'a ha itungo lyakwe, hangi' mugati' na kwikala kwakwe wav'age ali' bi'hi' na Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nowa wav'age na v'ana v'adatu' v'a ki'gosya: Shemu, Hamu na Yafeti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha itungo lyeni'lo Mulungu wayi'wonaga welelo ku'v'a yav'ipaga na kokala wu'kandi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ku'nguno yi'li' nhana ki'la yu'mo wav'ipyaga nzi'la yakwe mu welelo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulungu wamuwi'laga Nowa, “Gi'si' ni'na ndaka ya ku'v'azimangu'zya v'antu' v'ose, ku'nguno v'okazyaga welelo wu'kenagu'zi. Nhana nku'v'azimangu'zya v'antu' v'ose mu welelo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sumbwa ev'e wiv'ezezye safina ku' mbawo zya muti' gwa muvinje, u'gawu'le masenge, na u'gav'ile lami mugati' na ha ibala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'layi'v'ezye i'vi: Wu'lihu wayo makono",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6:15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mukono gu'mo gu'gelani'lile na mita yi'mo. Vipimo ku' Ki'ebulania vili': wu'lihu zilaa magana adatu', wu'gali'nhu zilaa maku'mi atano, na wi'i'ma zilaa maku'mi adatu'.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " igana li'mo na maku'mi adatu' na kenda, wu'gali'nhu wayo makono maku'mi av'i'li' na itano, na wi'i'ma wayo makono iku'mi na atano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Safina yeni'yo u'yi'tu'u'li'le muzigo mu lu'v'azu lwayo. U'v'ezye twano tu'datu': kamo ka ha nsi'li'li', ka hagati' na ka ha igu'lya. U'yi'vimbe ha igu'lya, na u'lekele kapunye ka wu'lihu wa mukono hagati', kav'e hagati' ya kano na wu'vimbe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nhana, ndalete kamilamasenga ya minzi' ku'zimangu'zya vitundwa vyose vya myu'ye ya wu'panga. Ki'la ki'tundwa mu welelo ki'lafwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ali'vi ev'e ku' wako ndaki'ndi'ke ilagano lyanne. Ev'e u'lingi'le mu safina haki'mo na muki' wako, v'ana v'ako na v'aki' v'av'o. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mugati' na vitundwa vyose vya muv'i'li' vya myu'ye ya wu'panga, u'sole vya ki'gosya na vya ki'ki'ma u'viyane mu safina, ki'gele u'vipi'zye na lu'fu viv'e na wu'zuwu'ku haki'mo nanho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“U'latu'u'lemo nnoni, ndimu, na vitundwa vingi' vyose vya ku'yu'mba ha igu'lya na nsi', na ki'la ki'mo ku' wu'tundwa wacho, vilize ku' wako viv'i'li' viv'i'li' ki'gele u'vitu'u'le viv'e na wu'zuwu'ku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'kuminge ki'la ki'liwa, u'sole vyose hekeheke ku'nguno yinywe na vitundwa i'vyo u'lingi'le navyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe Nowa wav'ezyaga vyeni'vyo. Wav'ezyaga ki'ti' i'vyo Mulungu wamulagi'li'zyaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
